# Sandboxed E2E: downloaded Obsidian builds, the vault copy and run artifacts.
# Generated by obsidian_plugin_e2e.
.e2e-obsidian/
e2e/.wdio/
# The scaffold's own vault: keep the directory (the service fails in onPrepare
# when the vault path does not exist) but not its contents. A bare `e2e/vault/`
# would ignore the directory itself, so a fresh clone would fail the first run
# again. Note this file is appended once; a vault created later at another path
# needs the same treatment by hand.
e2e/vault/*
!e2e/vault/.gitkeep
